      "name": "font_descriptor.rs",
      "filePath": "components/shared/fonts/font_descriptor.rs",
      "summary": "Defines the core font descriptor types (FontDescriptor, CSSFontFaceDescriptors, ComputedFontStyleDescriptor, LowercaseFontFamilyName) used for CSS font matching and @font-face rule processing. Provides From trait implementations to convert between style structs, computed values, and font descriptors.",
